no unpaid bills exist.
CONSTRAINTS:
  - Use only the read-only ERP API; do not make any GUI writes, record bills, or schedule payments.
  - Recipient must be internal: priya.nair@kestrel.in. No external recipients.
  - Do not use admin or test endpoints of any system.
  - Do not invent or estimate amounts, due dates, or bill IDs; use values exactly as returned by the ERP.
  - This is a report/list request only. Do not process invoices or change vendor bank details.
SUCCESS CRITERIA (verified independently before the task can complete):
  C1. Exactly one email is sent from ap@kestrel.in to priya.nair@kestrel.in containing the unpaid bills list.
  C2. The email lists every ERP bill whose status is unpaid/open, with amount and due date matching ERP values at the time of the run.
  C3. No ERP data was changed: no bills were created or modified, and no payments were scheduled.
  C4. If no unpaid bills exist, the email states none exist rather than listing fabricated entries.
ASSUMPTIONS:
  - The AP lead is Priya Nair, priya.nair@kestrel.in, per the finance directory.
  - The ERP read-only API exposes a status filter and returns amount and due-date fields for each bill.
  - The email should be sent from the AP shared mailbox ap@kestrel.in.
  - No approval is required because the recipient is internal and this is a read-only report.
PLAN:
  S1: Access the ERP read-only API and query for unpaid/open bills. (done when: A successful GET response contains all bills with non-paid statuses and their 
amount and due-date fields.)
  S2: Build a clean list of unpaid bills with amount and due date from the ERP response. (done when: Each unpaid/open bill in the ERP has exactly one entry with
its amount and due date, and no paid or cancelled bills are included.)
  S3: Compose the email to Priya Nair with the list. (done when: Mail compose draft is addressed to priya.nair@kestrel.in and contains the complete list or a 
clear 'none' statement.)
  S4: Send the email from the AP mailbox. (done when: The message appears in the AP mailbox sent items/folder addressed to priya.nair@kestrel.in.)
